    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιθέω</span></b> , generally pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run round about,</i>
			
